# Package com.orange.ouds.theme.whitelabel

This package contains the core `WhiteLabelTheme` and `WhiteLabelFontFamily` classes, which extend the Wireframe theme with customization capabilities for fonts and colors.

# Package com.orange.ouds.theme.whitelabel.tokens.material

This package provides customizable Material color tokens (`WhiteLabelMaterialColorTokens`) that inherit from Wireframe with the ability to override specific values for custom branding.

# Package com.orange.ouds.theme.whitelabel.tokens.semantic

This package provides customizable semantic color tokens (e.g., `WhiteLabelColorSemanticTokens`, `WhiteLabelColorActionSemanticTokens`, `WhiteLabelColorBgSemanticTokens`) that inherit from Wireframe tokens with the ability to override specific color values for custom branding. All parameters default to `Color.Unspecified`, which falls back to Wireframe values.